  "id": "BIT-consul-2026-16496",
  "summary": "terraform-mcp-server vulnerable to cross-user credential inheritance if an MCP session ID is obtained by another user",
  "details": "The terraform-mcp-server before version 1.1.0 is vulnerable to an authorization bypass in the streamable-HTTP stateful transport mode that may allow a user who obtains another user's MCP session ID to have their tool calls executed using that user's Terraform credentials. This vulnerability, CVE-2026-16496, is fixed in terraform-mcp-server 1.1.0.",
